<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block title %}Event Booking System{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4361ee 0%, #4895ef 100%);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .email-content {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4361ee 0%, #4895ef 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #4361ee;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #666;
        }
        .detail-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .badge-success {
            background-color: #22c55e;
            color: white;
        }
        .badge-warning {
            background-color: #ff9e00;
            color: white;
        }
        .badge-danger {
            background-color: #ef4444;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>🎫 Event Booking System</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            {% block content %}{% endblock %}
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
            <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Event Booking System. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

